x86_64-windows  a member of a local class that names the enclosing member function's own class - `const P &` in P::go's local Order - spells P again, where both ABIs reuse it from the enclosing function's encoding (Itanium `RKS_`, Microsoft `AEBV3@`): cxx1 does not carry the function's substitutions into its local entities. These are local names nothing outside the unit links against; found by M1's L10 case, 2026-10-23, and left for the mangler.
